{"id":8627047,"html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-math/merge_requests/2848","number":2848,"state":"merged","title":"[Bugfix] Use RINT cast in experimental sqrt","url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-math/pulls/2848","issue_url":"https://api.gitcode.com/api/v5/repos/cann/ops-math/pulls/2848/issues","body":"Fixes #1505\n\n## 修改内容\n- 将 experimental/math/sqrt 内核中非 float32 路径的结果回 cast 舍入模式从 `CAST_CEIL` 改为 `CAST_RINT`。\n- 对变更文件执行 clang-format。\n\n## 本地验证\n- `git diff --check`：通过。\n- `clang-format --dry-run --Werror experimental/math/sqrt/op_kernel/sqrt.h`：通过。\n- `Select-String` 确认目标位置已使用 `CAST_RINT`。\n\n## 说明\n- 本地缺少 Ascend/CANN SDK 与硬件环境，未执行 op_kernel 编译和精度 UT，已触发 GitCode CI。","assignees_number":23,"assignees":[{"id":"68777000fc42115893ad8b8c","login":"songkai111","name":"songkai111","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/songkai111","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"686747584ce6f320c9b62908","login":"fullt","name":"fulltower","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/fullt","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822d6aa6a68fa1fec6cc983","login":"luowen203_gg123","name":"luowen203_gg123","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/luowen203_gg123","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"682accc0a6508e17e040cd22","login":"zhangzijie","name":"zhangzijie","avatar_url":"","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhangzijie","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68720f022801c54852644441","login":"LiWei79","name":"DevLeev","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/LiWei79","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"68848e03dea8931fab644b6e","login":"zhangyuxiang0119","name":"张喻翔","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ac/ef/1470773a2803ce17fd42f4bc8760feb28790f49717caa969d7dac783ff8fecf6.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhangyuxiang0119","assignee":true,"code_owner":false,"accept":false},{"id":"6822c65e59bdd61f837dbc5a","login":"yu-xinjie62","name":"於欣洁","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/